<br/>In short, it is worthwhile to go for the two-piece bonus as the loss of stats is offset by the damage increase to our primary damage over time ability. The four-piece bonus will be more dependent on the available alternative items that you have.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gems">Gems</h4>For gemming, you will want to use these slots to balance out your Hit and reach your meta gem requirement. Most often it is not worthwhile to get the gem bonus unless it is a spell damage bonus or spell hit bonus. For more in-depth info on gems, see the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-enchants-gems-pve">Gem Guide.</a>
