<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Warlock DPS in Phase 2</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45497/crown-of-luminescence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of Luminescence</span></a> stands <i>head</i> and shoulders above the alternatives, but how likely are we to get this helm? While it looks like a <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_priest.gif");'></span>
<span class="c5">Priest</span> tier piece, that isn't the issue at hand. The biggest challenge we face is <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33350/mimiron">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mimiron</span></a>. This item only drops if the boss gets cleared during the Hard Mode challenge, making it (as the name might imply) significantly harder to get.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45532/cowl-of-dark-whispers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_136.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cowl of Dark Whispers</span></a> is the closest one on one swap because it doesn't have any hit rating, especially considering you might be coming from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40562/hood-of-rationality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hood of Rationality</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40421/valorous-plagueheart-circlet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Plagueheart Circlet</span></a> which do not have any hit rating on them. Alternatively,  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45150/collar-of-the-wyrmhunter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Collar of the Wyrmhunter</span></a> is an excellent choice if you are in need of extra hit rating.<br/>
<br/>On its own, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46140/conquerors-deathbringer-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_131.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Hood</span></a> is hardly better then the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40562/hood-of-rationality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hood of Rationality</span></a>. However, you should consider it as a viable alternative to enabling your <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=837/deathbringer-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Deathbringer Garb</span></a> two-set bonus if you have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32906/freya">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Freya</span></a> (25-man Hard Mode). As such,  you can substitute <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46139/conquerors-deathbringer-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Leggings</span></a> with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46140/conquerors-deathbringer-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_131.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Hood</span></a>. As an added bonus, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46140/conquerors-deathbringer-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_131.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Hood</span></a>  will be easier to get than the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45497/crown-of-luminescence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of Luminescence</span></a> - an item that everyone and their mother will be after. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46140/conquerors-deathbringer-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_131.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Hood</span></a> (and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46137/conquerors-deathbringer-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Robe</span></a>) are both buyable with 58 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a>.<div class="box">
<b>Head Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50368/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Burning Mysteries</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44075/arcanum-of-dominance">
