<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders</h3>It is almost hard to believe but our best in slot shoulder piece comes from 10-man content, Hard Mode but 10-man nonetheless. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46068/amice-of-inconceivable-horror">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amice of Inconceivable Horror</span></a> should be somewhat less rare because of this reason. The difference between the next best couple of shoulders is relatively big compared to the trade-offs from other slots.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46136/conquerors-deathbringer-shoulderpads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Shoulderpads</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45253/mantle-of-wavering-calm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Wavering Calm</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46013/underworld-mantle">
