<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back</h3>Don't worry Algalon has your <i>back</i>, he's related to three out of four of the new best caster cloaks. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46053/reply-code-alpha">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_arcanetorrent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reply-Code Alpha</span></a> dropped by Alagon rewards us with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45618/sunglimmer-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Cloak</span></a>, the best available cape in the 25-man version. The 10-man version of this quest provides <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46321/sunglimmer-drape">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Drape</span></a>, the third-best cloak. It doesn't stop there for Algalon, the 10-man version of Algalon itself also drops a great back if you are in need of hit rating, namely <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46042/drape-of-the-messenger">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Messenger</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Last but not least cloak is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45242/drape-of-mortal-downfall">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of Mortal Downfall</span></a> from Hard Mode 25-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32867/steelbreaker">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Steelbreaker</span></a>. It should be noted that it has a big chunk of hit rating. This can either be a blessing or a curse depending on the rest of your equipment, make sure it doesn't cause your <i>downfall</i> by being over the hit cap and wasting the buffed ilvl stats on this one.<div class="box">
<b>Cloak Enchant</b>:<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55642/lightweave-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=197/tailoring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a>) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63765/springy-arachnoweave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Springy Arachnoweave</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>) &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=39003/scroll-of-enchant-cloak-greater-speed">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Cloak - Greater Speed</span></a></div>
