<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest</h3>Just as with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40423/valorous-plagueheart-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Plagueheart Robe</span></a> in the previous phase our tier chest isn't the strongest option. However, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46137/conquerors-deathbringer-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Robe</span></a> isn't far behind the best alternatives and this makes it a solid option to enable our two-piece set bonus from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=837/deathbringer-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Deathbringer Garb</span></a>. The additional damage that it enables for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47843/unstable-affliction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unstableaffliction_3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unstable Affliction</span></a> more than makes up for the loss in other attributes and stats. Another fact is that we are swapping hit pieces if we upgrade from tier 7 to tier 8 (albeit we gain an extra 26) making it a relatively easy transition. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45421/valorous-deathbringer-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Deathbringer Robe</span></a> is a clear temporary contender until you can get the 25-man version. Until you got either version of the tier 8, you can keep your current <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40423/valorous-plagueheart-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Plagueheart Robe</span></a> as an item in your arsenal to work around your hit cap.<br/>
<br/>That leaves two more chest alternatives that beat out <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44002/the-sanctums-flowing-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Sanctum's Flowing Vestments</span></a>, the strongest standalone chest from the previous phase. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45272/robes-of-the-umbral-brute">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of the Umbral Brute</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45240/raiments-of-the-iron-council">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_65.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raiments of the Iron Council</span></a> both are stronger solely compared to the tier 8 chest variants, but taking into account our set bonus they are mostly wasted on us.<div class="box">
<b>Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38928/scroll-of-enchant-chest-major-spirit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Chest - Major Spirit</span></a> &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44465/scroll-of-enchant-chest-powerful-stats">
