<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44008/unsullied-cuffs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unsullied Cuffs</span></a> stays one of the best wrists available, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45446/grasps-of-reason">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grasps of Reason</span></a> can be considered its bigger and stronger sibling. It has all the same stats distribution down to the <span class="q2">
<i>+4 spirit</i></span> <span class="socket-red"></span>red socket bonus, just with more of everything. Note though that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45446/grasps-of-reason">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grasps of Reason</span></a> only drops from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33293/xt-002-deconstructor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">XT-002 Deconstructor</span></a> Hard Mode.<br/>
<br/>Those who haven't gotten <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44008/unsullied-cuffs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unsullied Cuffs</span></a> yet in the previous phase and won't be facing <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33293/xt-002-deconstructor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">XT-002 Deconstructor</span></a> Hard Mode immediately don't have to fret, plenty of great bracer options have been introduced this phase. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45549/grips-of-chaos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_31b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grips of Chaos</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45275/bracers-of-unleashed-magic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Unleashed Magic</span></a> are great options if you are in need of some extra hit rating, where <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45146/shackles-of-the-odalisque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shackles of the Odalisque</span></a> provides a solid option until you eventually down <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33293/xt-002-deconstructor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">XT-002 Deconstructor</span></a> Hard Mode and get your sweet reward in the form of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45446/grasps-of-reason">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grasps of Reason</span></a>.<div class="box">
<b>Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57691/fur-lining-spell-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Spell Power</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>) &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44470/scroll-of-enchant-bracer-superior-spellpower">
