<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands</h3>We will need to get our hands dirty if we want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a>.  - hands down the best pair of gloves we can get our hands on. All kidding aside, being an Algalon drop may limit the chances of seeing these early in the phase. It may be easier to do 10-man Algalon for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46045/pulsar-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pulsar Gloves</span></a>, bringing a nice chunk of hit. Whilst on the topic of Hard Modes <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45520/handwraps-of-the-vigilant">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handwraps of the Vigilant</span></a> from Hard Mode <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33271/general-vezax">
<span class="tinyicontxt">General Vezax</span></a> are another option.<br/>
<br/>If you don't need any hit rating and won't be doing 25-man Hard Modes anytime soon you could consider  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45273/handwraps-of-plentiful-recovery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_57.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handwraps of Plentiful Recovery</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45840/touch-of-the-occult">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Touch of the Occult</span></a>. Alternatively, if you are in dire need of extra hit rating consider using the tier gloves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46135/conquerors-deathbringer-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Gloves</span></a>.<div class="box">
<b>Gloves Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
