<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist</h3>As with most of the best items in this phase, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45619/starwatchers-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starwatcher's Binding</span></a> also comes from Algalon 25-man, providing a massive amount of spell power with 2 extra sockets on top of it. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45119/embrace-of-the-leviathan">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_49.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Embrace of the Leviathan</span></a> from 25-man Normal Mode <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33113/flame-leviathan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Flame Leviathan</span></a> is essentially the same minus the sockets.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45557/sash-of-ancient-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Ancient Power</span></a> is also a solid option if you're in need of hit rating. This belt along with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45558/cord-of-the-white-dawn">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_40b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the White Dawn</span></a> are Bind on Equipped and can be crafted by a <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif");'></span>Tailor using <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45087/runed-orb">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_runedorb_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Orb</span></a>, the new BoE crafting material in Ulduar - expect these to be on the pricy side early in the phase.<div class="box">
<b>Belt Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41611/eternal-belt-buckle">
