<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs</h3>Our best pants aren't anything too <i>fancy</i> - ideally we make use of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46139/conquerors-deathbringer-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Leggings</span></a> to complete our two-piece bonus of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-86/conquerors-deathbringer-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Garb</span></a>, toghether with the tier chest. Our tier pants are equally as good as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46034/leggings-of-profound-darkness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Profound Darkness</span></a> which drops from 10-man Hard Mode <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33271/general-vezax">
<span class="tinyicontxt">General Vezax</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>From a pure stat perspective, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> is slightly stronger than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46139/conquerors-deathbringer-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Leggings</span></a>.  However, the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-86/conquerors-deathbringer-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Garb</span></a> two-piece set bonus makes up for this deficit. In addition, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> is heavy on hit rating and is liable to put us well over the hit cap. With that being said, we can still make use of these pants by pairing it with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46140/conquerors-deathbringer-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_131.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Hood</span></a> to satisfy our <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-86/conquerors-deathbringer-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Garb</span></a> set bonus. This frees us up from the highly sought after <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45497/crown-of-luminescence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of Luminescence</span></a>. Please note that if you decide to use the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46140/conquerors-deathbringer-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_131.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Hood</span></a>, you will have to compensate for the additional hit rating somewhere else.For example, you might use the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45457/staff-of-endless-winter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Endless Winter</span></a> instead of  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45990/fusion-blade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_132.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fusion Blade</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>If you got spare <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a> laying around, and didn't have get that great of a pants in Phase 1 you can consider getting <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45848/legwraps-of-the-master-conjurer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of the Master Conjurer</span></a> for 39 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a>. Considering it doesn't have any hit rating on it, it can also function as a temporary piece to balance out your hit rating on the rest of your gear.<div class="box">
<b>Pants Spellthread</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41602/brilliant-spellthread">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_astralrecalgroup.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Spellthread</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41601/shining-spellthread">
