<span class="tinyicontxt">Flame Leviathan</span></a> outshine <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45537/treads-of-the-false-oracle">
