<span class="tinyicontxt">Yogg-Saron</span></a> ever so slightly. Both drop from 25-man Hard Modes, and don't have any hit rating on them. It should be said that none of the good boots in this phase have any hit rating on them, making it easy to swap them out or run alternatives, especially if upgrading from the Phase 1 best in slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40558/arcanic-tramplers">
