<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Warlock DPS in Phase 2</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck</h3>Although all the best necklaces this phase come from Hard Modes, they also all are relatively close in value (depending on your needs). <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a> from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33113/flame-leviathan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Flame Leviathan</span></a> Hard Mode is the best option if you can make use of the high amount of hit rating on it.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45243/sapphire-amulet-of-renewal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_30naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sapphire Amulet of Renewal</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45447/watchful-eye-of-fate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Watchful Eye of Fate</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45933/pendant-of-the-shallow-grave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Shallow Grave</span></a> are all solid direct upgrades over the Phase 1 best in slot item <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44661/wyrmrest-necklace-of-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_amulet_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wyrmrest Necklace of Power</span></a>, and don’t require  shuffling around hit rating to equip.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45443/charm-of-meticulous-timing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_amulet_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Charm of Meticulous Timing</span></a> is technically an upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44661/wyrmrest-necklace-of-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_amulet_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wyrmrest Necklace of Power</span></a> but with the stronger alternatives available to <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warlock.gif");'></span>
<span class="c9">Warlocks</span> this should be left for the healers, at least if you still want to get topped off after a <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57946/life-tap">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_burningspirit.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Life Tap</span></a> session.<br/>
<br/>If you didn't get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44661/wyrmrest-necklace-of-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_amulet_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wyrmrest Necklace of Power</span></a> strung around your neck in Phase 1 (or if you are in search of an alternative without hit rating) you can consider spending your <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a> on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45822/evokers-charm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Evoker's Charm</span></a>. Note that if you already have it and aren't in need of an alternative without a hit rating it will be a side grade instead of an upgrade.<div class="pad"></div>
