<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets</h3>This is where things get slightly more interesting. The big three trinkets are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_hyjal_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illustration of the Dragon Soul</span></a>. Technically <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a> are the strongest combination, but both of these can safely be replaced by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_hyjal_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illustration of the Dragon Soul</span></a> until you get both for a minor DPS loss compared to the absolute best combination.<br/>
<br/>A lot of us might already have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_hyjal_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illustration of the Dragon Soul</span></a>. We can use rank 1 <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=1454/life-tap">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_burningspirit.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Life Tap</span></a> to maintain full stacks of the buff, even outside of combat. This makes it essentially a static trinket providing 200 spell power.<br/>
<br/>If you have a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40255/dying-curse">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_naxxramas03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dying Curse</span></a> lying around from tier 7, it’s still a great option for maintaining your hit cap while swapping items around earlier in the phase.<div class="pad"></div>
