<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Warlock DPS in Phase 2</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="2-handed-weapons">2-Handed Weapons</h3>Unfortunately for staff fans, one-handers with an offhand have historically been the stronger option. However, Ulduar does provide a competitive alternative. If you’re unable to get your hands on the best one-handers, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45457/staff-of-endless-winter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Endless Winter</span></a> combined with the stronger two-hand enchant <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45056/scroll-of-enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Staff - Greater Spellpower</span></a> is a great contender compared to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> (or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45990/fusion-blade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_132.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fusion Blade</span></a>) + <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45617/cosmos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cosmos</span></a>. Due to the difference in hit rating, the staff can be easily combined with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a>. This is likely less contested compared to the absolute technical Best in Slot setup. This would also free you up to use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46140/conquerors-deathbringer-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_131.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Deathbringer Hood</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45497/crown-of-luminescence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of Luminescence</span></a>, another highly contested item.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45457/staff-of-endless-winter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Endless Winter</span></a> also can serve great as a crit-swapping weapon to snapshot a juicy <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47813/corruption">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_abominationexplosion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corruption</span></a> at the start of the fight. It has slightly more crit rating without sacrificing a significant amount of other stats (which also have value before you have applied <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47813/corruption">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_abominationexplosion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corruption</span></a>). <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-rotation-cooldowns-abilities-pve#weaponswap">To learn more about weapon swapping see the Affliction rotation guide.</a>
