<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wand">Wand</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45294/petrified-ivy-sprig">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Ivy Sprig</span></a> drops from 10-man Hard Mode <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32906/freya">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Freya</span></a>, it is the best wand in this phase and will last us a solid while. It does have a good chunk of hit rating on it - for a low hit alternative consider using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45511/scepter-of-lost-souls">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scepter of Lost Souls</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=37238/rod-of-the-fallen-monarch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rod of the Fallen Monarch</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45511/scepter-of-lost-souls">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scepter of Lost Souls</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45170/scepter-of-creation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scepter of Creation</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45713/nurturing-touch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nurturing Touch</span></a> deserve mentions as a crit-swapping options. They have substantial crit rating without sacrificing a significant amount of other stats (which also have value before you have applied <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47813/corruption">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_abominationexplosion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corruption</span></a>). <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-rotation-cooldowns-abilities-pve#weaponswap">To learn more about weapon swapping see the Affliction rotation guide.</a>
