<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="about-the-author">About the Author</h4>Zephan is the creator and admin of the <a href="https://discord.com/invite/3fvUDqF" target="_blank">Classic Warlock Discord</a>.  I have always had a knack for warlocks and evidence-based methodologies in general. I have created spreadsheets for Classic Vanilla and Classic Burning Crusade providing answers to questions based on underlying game mechanics and math.<br/>
<br/>It is my aim to give back to the community and educate/<wbr/>inform new and old warlocks alike about both the newest findings and the correct information about warlocks.</div>